	(text "PRIMARY POWER CONVERSION: GaN FULL-BRIDGE LLC RESONANT STAGE\n- Resonant Frequency: fres = 100 kHz - 250 kHz (ZVS soft-switching across full load range)\n- Switches: 4x EPC2020 GaN HEMTs (60V, 90A, Ron = 2.2 mOhm, Qg = 14 nC)\n- Isolated Drivers: 2x TI UCC21520DW (5.7 kVrms galvanic isolation barrier, 4A/6A source/sink)\n- Planar Transformer T1: Ratio 1:12, Interleaved windings, Primary current = 14.8A RMS"
